{
  "title": "VPC · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "AWS 안에 서비스용 네트워크를 만들고 주소와 연결 경로를 구성합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#guide-1\">네트워크를 구성하는 순서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#guide-2\">서비스 계층별로 접근 구분하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>57 / 62</span></div><h1>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>VPC는 <strong>AWS에서 직접 구성해 사용하는 가상 네트워크</strong>입니다. 서버에 사용할 IP 주소 범위와 서버를 나눠 둘 공간, 외부와 통신할 경로를 정할 수 있습니다.</p><p>VPC 안에는 웹 서버와 애플리케이션, 데이터베이스 등을 배치합니다. 하나의 VPC는 한 리전에 속하며, 그 안에 여러 AZ의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>을 만들 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"vpc-cidr\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"subnet\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"route-table\"></span><h2>네트워크를 구성하는 순서</h2><p>먼저 CIDR<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>로 VPC의 주소 범위를 정하고, 서브넷별로 범위를 나눕니다. 각 서브넷에는 다른 서브넷과 겹치지 않는 주소를 할당합니다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우팅 테이블</a>은 트래픽이 목적지에 도달할 경로를 정합니다. 인터넷 연결에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">인터넷 게이트웨이</a>, 비공개 서버의 외부 접속에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>, AWS 서비스의 비공개 접근에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC 엔드포인트</a>를 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"network-security\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"dns-and-dhcp\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"connectivity\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"default-vpc\"></span><h2>서비스 계층별로 접근 구분하기</h2><p>사용자의 요청을 받는 로드 밸런서는 공개 접근 경로에 두고, 애플리케이션과 데이터베이스는 비공개 서브넷에 둘 수 있습니다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">보안 그룹</a>으로 계층 사이에 필요한 연결만 허용합니다.</p><p>다른 VPC나 사내 네트워크와 연결할 계획이 있다면 처음부터 주소가 겹치지 않게 설계합니다. 연결 방식은 규모에 따라 피어링, Transit Gateway, VPN 또는 Direct Connect를 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>VPC 설계 순서</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>주소 계획</strong><span>VPC의 IP 범위</span></li><li><strong>서브넷 분리</strong><span>AZ·서비스 계층 구분</span></li><li><strong>경로와 권한</strong><span>필요한 통신만 허용</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">주소, 경로, 접근 허용을 함께 구성해야 실제 통신이 가능합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>쇼핑몰의 로드 밸런서는 공개 서브넷에, 주문 처리 서버와 데이터베이스는 비공개 서브넷에 둡니다. 데이터베이스는 주문 처리 서버에서 오는 연결만 허용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>CIDR</strong> — IP 주소 범위를 표시하는 방식입니다. 10.0.0.0/16처럼 시작 주소와 네트워크 범위를 나타내는 숫자를 함께 씁니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/what-is-amazon-vpc.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon VPC? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q005\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q005\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q005</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company plans to create one subnet in each of two Availability Zones. Which resource contains the network address range for those subnets?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q005\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 범위이고 그 안의 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q022\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q022\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q022</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q022/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to quickly establish an encrypted tunnel between its on-premises network and AWS over the internet. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Site-to-Site VPN</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>이 IPsec 터널을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q094\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q094\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q094</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">One VPC uses 10.0.0.0/16 and a VPC it must connect to uses 10.0.1.0/24. What prevents VPC peering between them?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The presence of route tables</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CIDR ranges overlap</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The VPCs are in different AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Each VPC has an ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 겹치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a> 연결에 사용할 수 없다. 주소 계획부터 바꿔야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q008\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q002\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">이전 용어 <b>Transit Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">다음 용어 <b>VPC Endpoint</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
